by nicolas-grekas at 2026-08-12T11:06:25Z

It did not, so I added one: when `list` leaves commands out, it now ends with

```
 Run with "-vvv" to list more commands.
```

naming the lowest verbosity that would show them (`-v`/`-vv`/`-vvv`). Nothing is printed when nothing is filtered, so existing output is unchanged.

Without it the option trades a cluttered `list` for commands nobody can find, which is the worse failure of the two.
